  <summary>Scheduler plugin for OpenRGB that schedules OpenRGB profile changes</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      The OpenRGB Scheduler Plugin is a plugin for OpenRGB that can schedule
      actions including profile changes and turning off the lights.
    </p><p>
      Features
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Schedule profile changes</li>
      <li>Schedule turning off all lights</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

